  "title": "$100M Brink's Truck Heist: Suspect Agrees to Plead Guilty",
  "text": "КУДИ: YouTube Shorts + TikTok + Instagram Reels (той самий video.mp4)\nОБКЛАДИНКА: cover.jpg (TikTok/Reels: «Обкладинка → Завантажити»; YouTube Shorts: у мобільному додатку)\nПОЗНАЧКА ШІ: YouTube «Altered or synthetic content = Yes», TikTok «AI-generated content»\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: НАЗВА ════════\n$100M Brink's Truck Heist: Suspect Agrees to Plead Guilty\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: ОПИС ════════\nUpdate on the $100 million Brink's semi truck jewelry heist in California: a suspect agrees to plead guilty.\n\nJuly 11, 2022: a Brink's semi left a jewelry show in San Mateo, CA with 73 bags. Prosecutors say a crew followed it ~300 miles toward Lebec and took 24 bags, about $100M in jewelry. Suspect Carlos Victor Mestanza Cercado agreed to plead guilty to one robbery count in a related 2022 AirTag truck robbery near Fontana (the driver was confronted with a small knife). Up to 20 years; restitution put at no less than $100M. Plea hearing Thu, Nov 19; three co-defendants go to trial in March 2027, two are still wanted.\n\nShould shippers be forced to track every high-value load?\n\nSource: FreightWaves (Nov 13, 2026).\nFootage: Pexels (illustrative). Voice: synthetic.\n\n#Shorts #TruckingNews #TruckDriver\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: ТЕГИ (поле Tags, через кому) ════════\nbrinks heist, brinks truck robbery, jewelry heist, cargo theft, 100 million heist, truck robbery california, true crime, trucking news, truck driver, truckers, cdl, cdl a, trucking industry, trucking, semi truck, truck driving, owner operator, freight, truck wire usa\n\n════════ TIKTOK / INSTAGRAM: ПІДПИС ════════\n$100M Brink's Truck Heist: Suspect Agrees to Plead Guilty\n\nShould shippers be forced to track every high-value load? 👇\n\n#brinks #heist #cargotheft #truecrime #trucking #truckdriver #truckingnews\n\n════════ ЗАКРІПЛЕНИЙ КОМЕНТАР ════════\nShould shippers be forced to track every high-value load? 👇",
