  "text": "КУДИ: YouTube Shorts + TikTok + Instagram Reels (той самий video.mp4)\nОБКЛАДИНКА: cover.jpg (TikTok/Reels: «Обкладинка → Завантажити»; YouTube Shorts: у мобільному додатку)\nПОЗНАЧКА ШІ: YouTube «Altered or synthetic content = Yes», TikTok «AI-generated content»\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: НАЗВА ════════\nYouTube Was Playing on His Log Tablet: 3 Killed in Kansas City Semi Crash\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: ОПИС ════════\nKansas City semi truck crash on US-71: police say YouTube was playing on the driver's ELD tablet.\n\nKansas City, MO, Mon Nov 9: police say a semi came up fast on stopped traffic on northbound US-71 and hit three vehicles. A mother (35) and her two sons, 9 and 6, were killed; three more people are critical. Investigators found no sign of emergency braking. An officer found an open tablet on the floorboard holding the truck's driving log, playing YouTube. The 39-year-old driver from Chicago is charged with three counts of involuntary manslaughter. A dash camera that may have recorded the crash was found.\n\nPhones and tablets in the cab: where do you draw the line?\n\nSources: KCTV5 (Nov 10, 2026), CDLLife (Nov 11, 2026).\nFootage: Pexels (illustrative). Voice: synthetic.\n\n#Shorts #TruckingNews #TruckDriver\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: ТЕГИ (поле Tags, через кому) ════════\nkansas city crash, semi truck crash, us 71 crash, distracted driving, eld tablet, truck accident, involuntary manslaughter, trucking news, truck driver, truckers, cdl, cdl a, trucking industry, trucking, semi truck, truck driving, owner operator, freight, truck wire usa\n\n════════ TIKTOK / INSTAGRAM: ПІДПИС ════════\nYouTube Was Playing on His Log Tablet: 3 Killed in Kansas City Semi Crash\n\nPhones and tablets in the cab: where do you draw the line? 👇\n\n#truckcrash #distracteddriving #kansascity #trucking #truckdriver #cdl #truckingnews\n\n════════ ЗАКРІПЛЕНИЙ КОМЕНТАР ════════\nPhones and tablets in the cab: where do you draw the line? 👇",
