  "text": "КУДИ: YouTube Shorts + TikTok + Instagram Reels (той самий video.mp4)\nОБКЛАДИНКА: cover.jpg (TikTok/Reels: «Обкладинка → Завантажити»; YouTube Shorts: у мобільному додатку)\nПОЗНАЧКА ШІ: YouTube «Altered or synthetic content = Yes», TikTok «AI-generated content»\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: НАЗВА ════════\nCDL Under a Month Old: Trailer Backed Across a Dark Florida Highway\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: ОПИС ════════\nMartin County, Florida truck crash: a trailer blocked SW Warfield Blvd at night; the driver's CDL was under a month old.\n\nMartin County, FL, Wed Nov 4: the sheriff says a truck driver turned onto a dead-end section of Fox Brown Road and backed out across SW Warfield Blvd, blocking both lanes. A Subaru hit the trailer; its 31-year-old driver died. Another family's dashcam caught their near miss. The 56-year-old driver from New York had a CDL that appears to have been issued in Queens less than a month earlier, per the sheriff. He was not taken into custody; FHP has 90 days to finish its investigation. Fifth traffic death on this road in 2026.\n\nHow long should a new CDL holder ride with a trainer?\n\n🚛 CDL-A drivers: Swan Trans pays up to $1/mile, up to $5,000/week. 1-minute form: link in our bio.\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: ТЕГИ (поле Tags, через кому) ════════\nnew cdl, cdl driver crash, florida truck crash, martin county, truck safety, non domiciled cdl, trailer crash, trucking news, truck driver, truckers, cdl, cdl a, trucking industry, trucking, semi truck, truck driving, owner operator, freight, truck wire usa\n\n════════ TIKTOK / INSTAGRAM: ПІДПИС ════════\nCDL Under a Month Old: Trailer Backed Across a Dark Florida Highway\n\nHow long should a new CDL holder ride with a trainer? 👇\n\nLooking for a carrier that pays? Swan Trans: up to $1/mile, up to $5,000/week. Link in bio.\n\n#cdl #truckcrash #florida #trucking #truckdriver #trucksafety #truckingnews\n\n════════ ЗАКРІПЛЕНИЙ КОМЕНТАР ════════\nHow long should a new CDL holder ride with a trainer? 👇",
