  "title": "They Used a Detroit Carrier's Name to Buy $760K of Diesel",
  "text": "КУДИ: YouTube Shorts + TikTok + Instagram Reels (той самий video.mp4)\nОБКЛАДИНКА: cover.jpg (TikTok/Reels: «Обкладинка → Завантажити»; YouTube Shorts: у мобільному додатку)\nПОЗНАЧКА ШІ: YouTube «Altered or synthetic content = Yes», TikTok «AI-generated content»\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: НАЗВА ════════\nThey Used a Detroit Carrier's Name to Buy $760K of Diesel\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: ОПИС ════════\nFuel card fraud: prosecutors say a Detroit trucking company's identity was used to run up $760,320 in diesel.\n\nFederal prosecutors (E.D. Michigan) say a Georgia man posed as the owner of Voyager Express, a real Detroit carrier, and applied for credit with Coyne Oil from a Gmail account in the company's name. Eight Pacific Pride fuel cards went to a Detroit apartment rented with an altered license. The cards were used in 23 states, Sept 2025–Jan 2026: $760,320 unpaid. Two Georgia men are charged with wire, mail and access-device fraud. One pleaded not guilty Nov 3; trial Dec 29. Both are presumed innocent.\n\nDo you know who else is using your MC number?\n\n🚛 CDL-A drivers: Swan Trans pays up to $1/mile, up to $5,000/week. 1-minute form: link in our bio.\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: ТЕГИ (поле Tags, через кому) ════════\nfuel card fraud, carrier identity theft, freight fraud, diesel, trucking fraud, detroit trucking, double brokering, trucking news, truck driver, truckers, cdl, cdl a, trucking industry, trucking, semi truck, truck driving, owner operator, freight, truck wire usa\n\n════════ TIKTOK / INSTAGRAM: ПІДПИС ════════\nThey Used a Detroit Carrier's Name to Buy $760K of Diesel\n\nDo you know who else is using your MC number? 👇\n\nLooking for a carrier that pays? Swan Trans: up to $1/mile, up to $5,000/week. Link in bio.\n\n#freightfraud #fuelcard #diesel #trucking #truckdriver #cdl #truckingnews\n\n════════ ЗАКРІПЛЕНИЙ КОМЕНТАР ════════\nDo you know who else is using your MC number? 👇",
