  "text": "КУДИ: YouTube Shorts + TikTok + Instagram Reels (той самий video.mp4)\nОБКЛАДИНКА: cover.jpg (TikTok/Reels: «Обкладинка → Завантажити»; YouTube Shorts: у мобільному додатку)\nПОЗНАЧКА ШІ: YouTube «Altered or synthetic content = Yes», TikTok «AI-generated content»\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: НАЗВА ════════\nTwo Trucks Stuck on the Tracks. Two Trains That Couldn't Stop\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: ОПИС ════════\nTrain vs truck: a BNSF train in Fort Worth, TX and a CSX train in Decatur, GA hit trucks stuck on railroad crossings.\n\nFort Worth, TX, Wed Nov 11, ~2:40 p.m.: a yard tractor pulling a tanker of beef tallow got stuck on a crossing; the driver jumped out before a BNSF train hit. A conductor rolled off the train and is in stable condition.\nDecatur, GA, Thu Nov 5, just before 9 a.m.: a CSX train hit an empty tractor-trailer with paper rolls stopped on the tracks, less than 200 yards from two schools. No injuries; why it was stopped there is unclear.\nNever enter a crossing unless you can clear it without stopping.\n\nEver had to stop on a crossing? How did you get out?\n\n🚛 CDL-A drivers: Swan Trans pays up to $1/mile, up to $5,000/week. 1-minute form: link in our bio.\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: ТЕГИ (поле Tags, через кому) ════════\ntrain vs truck, railroad crossing, train crash, bnsf, csx, truck stuck on tracks, rail safety, trucking news, truck driver, truckers, cdl, cdl a, trucking industry, trucking, semi truck, truck driving, owner operator, freight, truck wire usa\n\n════════ TIKTOK / INSTAGRAM: ПІДПИС ════════\nTwo Trucks Stuck on the Tracks. Two Trains That Couldn't Stop\n\nEver had to stop on a crossing? How did you get out? 👇\n\nLooking for a carrier that pays? Swan Trans: up to $1/mile, up to $5,000/week. Link in bio.\n\n#trainvstruck #railroadcrossing #train #trucking #truckdriver #cdl #truckingnews\n\n════════ ЗАКРІПЛЕНИЙ КОМЕНТАР ════════\nEver had to stop on a crossing? How did you get out? 👇",
