  "title": "FMCSA Pulls 133 ELDs: Truckers Have 60 Days to Switch",
  "text": "КУДИ: YouTube Shorts + TikTok + Instagram Reels (той самий video.mp4)\nОБКЛАДИНКА: cover.jpg (TikTok/Reels: «Обкладинка → Завантажити»; YouTube Shorts: у мобільному додатку)\nПОЗНАЧКА ШІ: YouTube «Altered or synthetic content = Yes», TikTok «AI-generated content»\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: НАЗВА ════════\nFMCSA Pulls 133 ELDs: Truckers Have 60 Days to Switch\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: ОПИС ════════\nFMCSA removed 133 ELDs from its registry (121 revoked): carriers have 60 days to switch to a registered device.\n\nFMCSA removed 133 ELDs from its registry: 121 revoked, 12 withdrawn by providers. Carriers using them have up to 60 days to switch to a registered device. Schemes described: a support line that erased drive time and added fake breaks while the driver was still driving; falsified logs uploaded during a roadside inspection; trucks shown at up to 130 mph to squeeze recorded drive time. FMCSA hasn't said how many carriers are affected. Check your device against the list.\n\nIs your ELD on the list? Check before the 60 days run out.\n\n🚛 CDL-A drivers: Swan Trans pays up to $1/mile, up to $5,000/week. 1-minute form: link in our bio.\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: ТЕГИ (поле Tags, через кому) ════════\neld, fmcsa, eld revoked, hours of service, electronic logging device, eld list, dot compliance, trucking news, truck driver, truckers, cdl, cdl a, trucking industry, trucking, semi truck, truck driving, owner operator, freight, truck wire usa\n\n════════ TIKTOK / INSTAGRAM: ПІДПИС ════════\nFMCSA Pulls 133 ELDs: Truckers Have 60 Days to Switch\n\nIs your ELD on the list? Check before the 60 days run out. 👇\n\nLooking for a carrier that pays? Swan Trans: up to $1/mile, up to $5,000/week. Link in bio.\n\n#eld #fmcsa #hoursofservice #trucking #truckdriver #cdl #truckingnews\n\n════════ ЗАКРІПЛЕНИЙ КОМЕНТАР ════════\nIs your ELD on the list? Check before the 60 days run out. 👇",
