  "text": "КУДИ: YouTube Shorts + TikTok + Instagram Reels (той самий video.mp4)\nОБКЛАДИНКА: cover.jpg (TikTok/Reels: «Обкладинка → Завантажити»; YouTube Shorts: у мобільному додатку)\nПОЗНАЧКА ШІ: YouTube «Altered or synthetic content = Yes», TikTok «AI-generated content»\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: НАЗВА ════════\nLights and Sirens On, and the Semi Still Hit Them: I-70 Pileup in Colorado\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: ОПИС ════════\nI-70 crash near Georgetown, Colorado: a semi hit two sheriff's SUVs and 8 other vehicles in a 10-vehicle pileup.\n\nEastbound I-70 near Georgetown, CO, Thu Nov 12, ~11:25 a.m.: two Clear Creek County sheriff's SUVs were moving through traffic with lights and sirens when a Freightliner lost control, hitting one SUV, then a Tacoma, a Range Rover, a Silverado and the second SUV. Ten vehicles in all. Both deputies and about five others were hurt; the semi driver wasn't. Eastbound lanes closed until about 6 p.m. Cause not released.\n\nI-70 in the mountains: what's your rule for speed and following distance?\n\n🚛 CDL-A drivers: Swan Trans pays up to $1/mile, up to $5,000/week. 1-minute form: link in our bio.\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: ТЕГИ (поле Tags, через кому) ════════\ni70 crash, colorado truck crash, semi crash, pileup, i 70 colorado, truck accident, mountain driving, trucking news, truck driver, truckers, cdl, cdl a, trucking industry, trucking, semi truck, truck driving, owner operator, freight, truck wire usa\n\n════════ TIKTOK / INSTAGRAM: ПІДПИС ════════\nLights and Sirens On, and the Semi Still Hit Them: I-70 Pileup in Colorado\n\nI-70 in the mountains: what's your rule for speed and following distance? 👇\n\nLooking for a carrier that pays? Swan Trans: up to $1/mile, up to $5,000/week. Link in bio.\n\n#i70 #colorado #truckcrash #trucking #truckdriver #cdl #truckingnews\n\n════════ ЗАКРІПЛЕНИЙ КОМЕНТАР ════════\nI-70 in the mountains: what's your rule for speed and following distance? 👇",
