  "text": "КУДИ: YouTube Shorts + TikTok + Instagram Reels (той самий video.mp4)\nОБКЛАДИНКА: cover.jpg (TikTok/Reels: «Обкладинка → Завантажити»; YouTube Shorts: у мобільному додатку)\nПОЗНАЧКА ШІ: YouTube «Altered or synthetic content = Yes», TikTok «AI-generated content»\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: НАЗВА ════════\nHackers Claim They Have J.B. Hunt Employee IDs (Ransomware)\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: ОПИС ════════\nJ.B. Hunt cyberattack: ransomware gang Whitearmor claims 140,838 employee records; Echo and Ryder also named.\n\nA new ransomware gang, Whitearmor, claims it hit J.B. Hunt (Oct 23), Echo Global Logistics (Oct 28) and Ryder. It claims 140,838 J.B. Hunt employee records with national IDs and 1.7M carrier contacts, and demands $5M, $10M and $20M in crypto. J.B. Hunt confirmed a cybersecurity incident and says it cut off the access; it hasn't confirmed the numbers. Echo didn't respond; Ryder declined to comment. Employees have filed suits: at least 6 vs J.B. Hunt, 1 vs Echo, 5 vs Ryder.\n\nHas your carrier ever told you your data was leaked?\n\n🚛 CDL-A drivers: Swan Trans pays up to $1/mile, up to $5,000/week. 1-minute form: link in our bio.\n\n════════ YOUTUBE: ТЕГИ (поле Tags, через кому) ════════\njb hunt, j.b. hunt, ransomware, data breach, cybersecurity, ryder, echo global logistics, trucking news, truck driver, truckers, cdl, cdl a, trucking industry, trucking, semi truck, truck driving, owner operator, freight, truck wire usa\n\n════════ TIKTOK / INSTAGRAM: ПІДПИС ════════\nHackers Claim They Have J.B. Hunt Employee IDs (Ransomware)\n\nHas your carrier ever told you your data was leaked? 👇\n\nLooking for a carrier that pays? Swan Trans: up to $1/mile, up to $5,000/week. Link in bio.\n\n#jbhunt #ransomware #databreach #trucking #truckdriver #cdl #truckingnews\n\n════════ ЗАКРІПЛЕНИЙ КОМЕНТАР ════════\nHas your carrier ever told you your data was leaked? 👇",
